      "heading": "Education Budget Amount for Alternative Career Question",
      "content": {
        "kind": "items",
        "items": [
          {
            "heading": "",
            "text": "When an MBA panel asks what alternative career you would choose, they are testing whether your MBA decision is considered, so a good answer names a realistic alternative, explains why you prefer the MBA and shows that the alternative is a genuine second option rather than a rehearsed line."
          },
          {
            "heading": "",
            "text": "Name one true alternative linked to your skills, say what it taught you about your priorities and explain why the MBA fits your goals better."
          },
          {
            "heading": "",
            "text": "Follow-up questions will test whether the alternative is real."
          }
        ]
      },
      "type": "proof",
      "title": "Education Budget Amount for Alternative Career Question"
